@startuml
' 第七週（claude 版本）：任務系統總覽，只畫類別名稱與關係。本週新增 HeavyRover、HeavyRoverTry。
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide members

class MissionLog
class Mission
class Rover
class MissionStep
class HeavyRover
class HeavyRoverTry

MissionLog ..> Mission
MissionLog ..> Rover
MissionLog ..> MissionStep
Mission --> "1" Rover : rover
Mission *-- "0..*" MissionStep : steps
Rover <|-- HeavyRover
HeavyRoverTry ..> HeavyRover
@enduml
